Z||000000||FieroMike||01-21-2001||03:01 PM||||Well, I've lived in Colorado for 22 years... and I'm headed to Houston this Friday!!  Anyone down in Houston with some Fiero's??  See you in much warmer weather!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>-Mike||||reg||4
