Z||000003||Cheever2||01-22-2001||11:18 AM||||FieroMike, it will be great to have you!  Although I got my first Fiero just over a year ago, I finally met with the Lone Star Fiero club just the other day.  Everybody's real nice, friendly & laid back.  Even a couple of autocrossers in the bunch. Here's the website, use the link in it to send a kite to Ray.  He'll answer you before long, I guarantee it. <A HREF="http://home.flash.net/~newboy/lonestar.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.flash.net/~newboy/lonestar.html</A> <P>By the way, so far I don't think anybody else in Houston besides me is on the Forum.  I'm trying to turn them on to it, but you know how people get into a rut with familiarity and hard to make 'em try something new.<P>I moved here in June of '99, from S.W. Ohio.  Thought I would miss the cold & snow but instead I have gotten spoiled.  Always something to do here too (if you don't mind doing it with 4.5 million other people).<P>Get my email off the profile & we'll talk sometime.  Not in Spanish however.  I haven't learned it yet.  Need to here.<BR> <P><BR>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 01-22-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000004||Cheever2||02-25-2001||12:41 PM||||Have not received any emails from you since you got here.  Hoping you're back on the Forum.  How was the move, and how are you liking Houston so far?<BR>||||reg||6
Z||000005||FieroMike||02-26-2001||08:59 AM||||I'm here, I just had to wait 3 weeks to get everything settled here and get my job.  I didn't bring my computer down, so I had to wait to get on with COMPAQ and get my computer and all.  Houston is real nice, there is a LOT to do.  I don't see too many Fieros down here, but we can start a trend I think!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  JetroGT, where did you move from??  Chuck, I do NOT miss the cold weather.. but everyone keeps telling me "Wait until Summer"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> We'll see!!  Carrolles, is Ray on this board??  I live right by WillowBrook mall, like 5 minutes away. Thanks!!!  Hope to see some of you soon!<P>Mike||||reg||10
